          SIZE 9 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 7 FGCOLOR 15 
     T-Ofabrica_hd.prf_comprob AT ROW 3.62 COL 21 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
          VIEW-AS FILL-IN NATIVE 
          SIZE 8 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 7 FGCOLOR 15 
