          SIZE 18 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     v-tip_plan AT ROW 3.62 COL 122 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-prf_plan AT ROW 3.62 COL 132 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-nro_plan AT ROW 3.62 COL 142 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_operacionfabrica AT ROW 4.81 COL 11 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-dsc_operacionfabrica AT ROW 4.81 COL 30 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_centrotrabajo AT ROW 4.81 COL 89 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-dsc_centrotrabajo AT ROW 4.81 COL 108 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_area AT ROW 6 COL 11 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-dsc_area AT ROW 6 COL 30 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_empleado AT ROW 6 COL 89 COLON-ALIGNED
     v-dsc_empleado AT ROW 6 COL 108 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_producto AT ROW 8.62 COL 3.2
     T-Ofabrica_hd.leyenda AT ROW 8.62 COL 45 NO-LABEL
          VIEW-AS EDITOR SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
          SIZE 83 BY 2.14
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     v-estado AT ROW 8.62 COL 127 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     v-cdg_insumo AT ROW 9.81 COL 5
     v-anulado AT ROW 9.81 COL 127 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     BRW-COMPUESTOS AT ROW 11 COL 1
     BRW-COMPONENTES AT ROW 17.91 COL 1
     RECT-2 AT ROW 1.29 COL 3
     RECT-3 AT ROW 1.24 COL 132
     "         Observaciones pertinentes a la presente orden de fabrica" VIEW-AS TEXT
          SIZE 83 BY 1 AT ROW 7.43 COL 45
          BGCOLOR 5 FGCOLOR 15 
     "  Articulos Agregados" VIEW-AS TEXT
          SIZE 30 BY 1 AT ROW 7.43 COL 13
          BGCOLOR 5 FGCOLOR 15 
     "         Estado y Vigencia" VIEW-AS TEXT
          SIZE 28 BY 1 AT ROW 7.43 COL 129
          BGCOLOR 5 FGCOLOR 15 
    WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY 
         SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D 
         AT COL 1 ROW 1
         SIZE 158 BY 26.43.


