"T-Ofabrica_dt.observacion" "Observaciones!Asociadas" ? "character" ? ? ? ? ? ? no ? no no ? yes no no "U" "" ""
     _Query            is OPENED
*/  /* BROWSE BRW-COMPONENTES */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

